Two ways to answer a question with the same model and the same tools:

- A **workflow** is a fixed pipeline. One model call turns the question into a small JSON
  object (which indicator, which year, ...); ordinary code then calls the right tool and
  writes the answer from a template. No loop, no choice of tools.
- An **agent** is a loop. The model chooses a tool, sees the result, chooses again, and
  stops when it decides to answer. `run_agent(..., BARE)` is the plain version: no
  protection at all.

